---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <h1>About this archive</h1>
  <p>
    Everything catalogued here is fiction. I like to write in an "epistolary" style.
    Which means I like to write "artifacts" from my alternate timeline. Letters, 
    memos, clippings, handouts! Enjoy.
  </p>
  <p>
    There are two "voices" you'll see on the site. The documents are always in world,
    wheras the archivist's notes, are me speaking as myself.
  </p>

  <h2>Colophon</h2>
  <p>
    Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a>.
    Static site, as little client-side JS as possible. And only system fonts, I'm saving you bandwidth.
  </p>
</Base>
